<div class="content-col"><h1 class="page-title">Kasganj October 2026 me UP me pehle number par</h1>
<p class="note">नोट: यह वेबसाइट एक स्वतंत्र जानकारी गाइड है — इसका आधिकारिक पोर्टल edistrict.up.gov.in से कोई संबंध नहीं है।</p>
<p class="updated-line">5 नवंबर 2026 की खबर · स्रोत नीचे दिया गया है</p>
<figure class="blog-featured"><img src="/images/blog/kasganj-certificate-clearance-october-2026-featured.webp" alt="Kasganj — eDistrict aavedan clearance, October 2026 (example illustration)" /><figcaption>उदाहरण चित्र • Illustration — edistrictupseva.com</figcaption></figure>
<section class="box"><h2>Kya hua</h2><p>October 2026 me Kasganj zila ne e-District seva ke <strong>97.20% aavedan clear</strong> kar diye aur poore Uttar Pradesh me <strong>pehle number par</strong> raha — report ke mutabiq zila ek baar phir is mamle me sab se aage raha। Ye aavedan income, caste, domicile jaise praman patron ke hain jo eDistrict portal se hote hain। Uttar Pradesh me eDistrict se ab tak <strong>36.90 करोड़ se zyada</strong> praman patra jari ho chuke hain, aur 47 vibhagon ki 325 se zyada sevayein is se judi hain — is liye ek zila ka 97% se upar clear karna koi chhoti baat nahi hai।</p></section>
<section class="box"><h2>97.2% ka matlab kya hai</h2><p>Ye number October 2026 me process hue aavedanon ka hisaab hai — matlab us mahine me Kasganj me jitne aavedan niptaye gaye, unme se 97.20% manzoor karke certificate jari kar diye gaye। Is ka ye matlab nahi ke har aavedan ek hi din me banta hai, aur na hi ye ke baaki aavedan hamesha ke liye reject ho gaye — kuch aavedan verification me hote hain, kuch me kami hoti hai jo theek karke dobara jama kiya ja sakta hai, aur kuch reject ho jate hain। Clearance rate asal me ye batata hai ke ek zila ka system kitna tez aur saaf-suthra chal raha hai।</p></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Aavedan ka safar — form se certificate tak</h2><p>Aapka aavedan banne tak kai marhalon se guzarta hai, aur har marhale par deri ho sakti hai। Ye safar aam taur par is tarah hota hai:</p><ol><li><strong>Form aur fee:</strong> eSathi par form bharein, documents upload karein aur ₹10–15 fee jama karein। SRN number turant milta hai — use sambhal kar rakhein।</li><li><strong>Field verification:</strong> Lekhpal ya Revenue Inspector aapke pate aur documents ki jaanch karte hain। Ye sab se lamba marhala hota hai, khaas taur par jab kaam ka dabav zyada ho।</li><li><strong>Tehsildar ki manzoori:</strong> Verification report ke baad Tehsildar aavedan manzoor karte hain।</li><li><strong>Certificate jari:</strong> Digitally signed certificate tayyar hota hai — use Citizen Login se download karein ya DigiLocker me dekhein।</li></ol><p>Kasganj ki ranking se ye samajh aata hai ke jahan field verification aur manzoori ka kaam time par hota hai, wahan aavedan late nahi hote।</p></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Baaki 2.8% kyun reh gaye</h2><p>Har zila me kuch aavedan rukte hain, aur wajahen aam taur par wahi hoti hain jo hamari guides me bhi likhi hain:</p><ul><li>Dhundhla scan ya dhundhli photo — jo aapko saaf nahi dikh raha, woh adhikari ko bhi nahi dikhega।</li><li>Aadhaar se naam ya janm tithi ka antar।</li><li>Self-declaration (ghoshna patra) ki kami ya galat format।</li><li>Galat gramin/shehri chayan — is se verification galat adhikari ke paas chali jati hai।</li></ul></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Aavedan reject kyun hote hain — 6 aam wajahen aur un ka hal</h2><p>Rejection ki wajah samajh lein to dobara aavedan karte waqt ghalti nahi hogi:</p><table class="data"><thead><tr><th>Wajah</th><th>Kya karein</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Dhundhla scan ya photo</td><td>200 DPI par black &amp; white scan karein, upload se pehle file khud khol kar padhein</td></tr><tr><td>Aadhaar se naam ka antar</td><td>Naam bilkul Aadhaar card jaisa likhein, chhota sa antar bhi rukavat banta hai</td></tr><tr><td>Ghoshna patra ki kami</td><td>Sahi format me bhara aur hastakshar kiya hua ghoshna patra lagayein</td></tr><tr><td>Galat gramin/shehri chayan</td><td>Apne pate ke hisaab se sahi vikalp chunein — gramin me Lekhpal, shehri me Revenue Inspector verify karte hain</td></tr><tr><td>Galat ya purana document</td><td>Har document ki validity aur format upload se pehle check karein</td></tr><tr><td>Payment pending</td><td>Payment katne ke baad 24–48 ghante intezar karein — dobara payment na karein, transaction ID sambhal kar rakhein</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="note">Rejection ka matlab jurmana nahi hota — kami theek karke dobara aavedan kar sakte hain, lekin pehle rejection ka remark zaroor padhein।</div></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Apne zila me aavedan tez kaise karein</h2><p>Kasganj ki misaal se ek baat saaf hai — jahan documents pehle se poore hote hain, wahan kaam tez hota hai। Aavedan karne se pehle ye tayyari kar lein:</p><ul class="checklist"><li>Saare documents pehle se tayyar rakhein — Aadhaar, pate ka proof, photo aur ghoshna patra।</li><li>Har file 100KB se kam rakhein aur upload se pehle khud khol kar check karein।</li><li>Aadhaar se juda mobile number chalu rakhein — OTP usi par aayega।</li><li>Form bharte waqt SRN number turant note kar lein — status isi se dekha jata hai।</li><li>Verification ke dauran pate par parivar ka koi sadasya uplabdh rahe to kaam tez hota hai।</li></ul></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Agar aapka aavedan late ho raha hai to</h2><p>Pehle official portal par SRN number se status check karein — bina login ke bhi status dekha ja sakta hai। Remark me likhi wajah padhein। Agar status "Under Verification" par ruka hai to field verification ka intezar ho sakta hai। Us ke baad helpdesk <strong>0522-2304706</strong> par sampark karein ya CM Helpline <strong>1076</strong> par shikayat darj karein। Aur agar tay time limit guzar jaye aur koi jawab na aaye to <a href="/blog/janhit-guarantee-appeal-delayed-certificate/">Janhit Guarantee Act 2011 ke tahat appeal</a> ka rasta bhi hai — pehli appeal SDM aur doosri appeal DM ke paas hoti hai।</p><figure class="shot"><img src="/images/status-page.webp" alt="eDistrict status check page (example)" /><figcaption>उदाहरण चित्र — status check page • edistrictupseva.com</figcaption></figure></section>
<section class="box"><h2>Ye khabar kahan se aayi</h2><p>Ye jaankari CertiSetu ki 5 नवंबर 2026 ki report se hai, jisme Dainik Bhaskar, Jagran aur ETV Bharat ko source bataya gaya hai। CertiSetu khud ek private platform hai, sarkari website nahi — is liye is khabar ko usi roop me padhein, aur apne aavedan ke liye hamesha official portal ki jaankari ko final manein।</p></section>
